title: SPIR-V Specification
author: John Kessenich, Google
author: Boaz Ouriel, Intel
author: Raun Krisch, Intel
changes:

=== Changes from Version 1.1

- Moved version number to SPIR-V 1.2

- New functionality:
  * Added <<OpExecutionModeId, *OpExecutionModeId*>> to allow using an _<id>_ to set the
    <<Execution_Mode, execution modes>> *SubgroupsPerWorkgroupId*, *LocalSizeId*, and *LocalSizeHintId*.
  * Added <<OpDecorateId, *OpDecorateId*>> to allow using an _<id>_ to set the
    <<Decoration, decorations>> *AlignmentId* and *MaxByteOffsetId*.
